<!--
  Links card for the sidebar.

  Copy this file to `links.md` in the same directory to enable the card:
      cp content/links.md.example content/links.md

  The card shows only when content/links.md exists and is non-empty.
  Content is Markdown, rendered in safe mode (raw HTML is stripped and
  unsafe links are removed). The card title comes from the translation key
  `sidebar.links_title`, so do NOT add a top-level heading here.

  Links open in a new tab automatically (target="_blank", rel="noopener
  noreferrer") — just write a normal Markdown link.
-->

- [Our website](https://example.com)
- [Photo archive](https://example.com/photos)
- [Frequently asked questions](https://example.com/faq)
